<section id="one-shot-prompting" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="one-shot-prompting">One-Shot Prompting</h2>
<p>One-shot prompting provides a single example input-output pair before the actual request.</p>
<section id="why-one-shot" class="level3">
<h3 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="why-one-shot">Why One-Shot?</h3>
<p>When generating data for 50 surf breaks, one-shot offers advantages:</p>
<table class="caption-top table">
<thead>
<tr class="header">
<th>Benefit</th>
<th>Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr class="odd">
<td>Consistency</td>
<td>Output anchored to known-good example</td>
</tr>
<tr class="even">
<td>Style matching</td>
<td>Tone and detail level preserved</td>
</tr>
<tr class="odd">
<td>Reduced ambiguity</td>
<td>Model infers unstated expectations</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</section>
