<p>Welcome all to my website, I will be using this site to document my personal projects and blog some of my thought around the tech industry, with a particular focus around ML, Deep Learning and AI.</p>
<p>I plan to further my development in AI, ML and Full Stack engineering through self directed projects, some which will be built locally at my own leisure, and others which I will endevour to host and maintain.</p>
<p>I will mainly be building Full Stack applications using Python/FastAPI with a mixture of different frontends as I continue to learn them. I do my public ML development through the use of Jupyter Notebooks on kaggle data to showcase my ML model development step by step.</p>
<p>It is a very exciting time in open source engineering with many powerful models being released weekly, I will endevour to implement a wide range of open source models and frameworks to fit real world use cases.</p>
<p>I plan on posting here at least weekly so please keep checking in if you are interested in what I am building, Thanks!</p>
